@* The desktop app's logo (MainWindow.axaml): models A and B as overlapping rounded squares with the matched rows as
   the overlap, and the wordmark "DAX" bold + "Diff" regular. Colours come from the --logo-* tokens. *@
<span class="logo-lockup" role="img" aria-label="DAXDiff">
    <svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="6" y="20" width="60" height="60" rx="16" fill="var(--logo-a)" />
        <rect x="34" y="20" width="60" height="60" rx="16" fill="var(--logo-b)" />
        <rect x="34" y="20" width="32" height="60" rx="16" fill="var(--logo-overlap)" stroke="var(--logo-gap)" stroke-width="6" />
    </svg>
    <span class="logo-word" aria-hidden="true"><b>DAX</b>Diff</span>
</span>
